==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**21,900 grants +3 Sprockets Z.
**22,000 grants +1 Rare Ticket.
**22,100 grants +1 Platinum Shard.
*Raised [[Secret Crush Cat (Special Cat)|Secret Crush Cat]], [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]] and [[Chalkboard Eraser Cat (Special Cat)|Chalkboard Eraser Cat]]'s + level caps from +40 to +45.
*Raised [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]]'s + level cap from +30 to +35.
*The [[Enemy Guide]] is now also accessible by clicking on enemy icons in the "Enemies appearing" window after tapping a stage name.
*Multiplier for XP drops in [[Legend Stages#Zero Legends|Zero Legend]] stages changed from 1 to 9.
*Added half-off events for spending XP on unlocking, upgrading and evolving units.

